ack for movement. Jetpack body movement is set to the direction of your hand.\n- Additional classic movements\n- Score points by collecting fish and finding randomly spawned treasure.\n\nGameplay:\n- Timed scoring mode, 2 minutes per level with over 10 minutes of gameplay in the demo (compare to 60 min in full game)\n- Freeplay mode, no timer and no scoring\n- This is intended to be a relaxing game and there is no way to take damage or die\n- Sea creatures include starfish, dinosaurs, sharks, squid, many common and exotic fish, and large sea mammals\n- Bonus island land lobby with climbing and level selection lobby", "short_description": "Free Demo of \"ZOSU Ocean\" (full game on App)\n- featuring 5 full levels, water lobby, and dry land island lobby\n- (vs 30 levels in full game)\n- Over 100 animals  to save, the majority are randomly spawned\n- 2 min scoring mode per level, or freeplay no timer or scoring mode\n- This is a relaxing game where you are ZOSU the explorer and you are collecting sea creatures to save them from extinction and to score points\n- Controls: built in right hand jetpack for movement"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://zosustudios.wixsite.com/website/about", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://zosustudios.wixsite.com/website/about", "publisher_name": "ZOSU Studios LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.zosustudios.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "DINOSAURS", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": 